# SPE2 modular two-completion producer.
# Required fragments:
#   fields.spe2_black_oil_q2_eg
#   fields.spe2_producer_control
#   materials.spe2_phase_pressure_closure
#   materials.spe2_black_oil_pvt
#   materials.spe2_producer_well
#   schedules.spe2_oil_rate_schedule
#   operators.spe2_producer_control
#
# The well material produces completion-local water, stock-tank-oil, and
# stock-tank-gas source properties. Stitch those properties into the selected
# component balances with block-restricted ADReferenceComponentSourceTerm
# objects. The control operators aggregate the reconstructed-pressure rates
# through AD, impose the published schedule, and switch to the 3000-psia datum
# BHP limit through complementarity.
